# {{ project_name_pascal }}

An [Arvel](https://github.com/mohamed-rekiba/arvel) application.

## Getting started

```bash
uv sync
uv run uvicorn public.asgi:asgi --reload
```

Visit `http://127.0.0.1:8000/` to see the welcome route.

## Layout

```
{{ project_name }}/
├── app/                # First-party application code
│   ├── Http/           # Controllers, middleware, form requests
│   ├── Models/         # ORM models
│   ├── Providers/      # Application service providers
│   └── Console/        # CLI commands
├── bootstrap/          # Application kernel (app.py, providers.py)
├── config/             # Configuration files (loaded by arvel.config.lookup)
├── database/           # Migrations, seeders, factories
├── public/             # ASGI entrypoint
├── routes/             # web.py, api.py, console.py
├── storage/            # Runtime artefacts (logs, cache, sessions)
└── tests/              # Feature + Unit tests
```

## Configuration

Copy `.env.example` to `.env` and adjust values for your environment.
Configuration is loaded from `config/` and read at runtime via
`arvel.config.lookup("app.name")`.

## Tests

```bash
uv run pytest
```
